<title>USA: Greenstone sets 1-for-10 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Greenstone sets 1-for-10 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenstone Roberts Advertising Inc said Tuesday its board had approved a one-for-10 reverse stock split in an attempt to maintain the minimum bid of $1 per share required to remain listed by Nasdaq.</p>
<p>If approved by shareholders at a special meeting July 29, the split would reduce the number of outstanding shares to 745,000, Greenstone said in a news release.</p>
<p>Greenstone shares closed Monday at 5/16 in Nasdaq trading.</p>
